review:
Anarcute
pros:
//fast game with modern day graphics with easy controls that moves from location A to B to C and so on
//good amount of action and special effects
cons:
//a lot of difficult battles/boss battles/mazes
//some overpowered enemies
//some enemies have unfair attacks
//could use more recruits and weapons
//sometimes too many enemies constantly spawn
//repetitive with increasing difficulty
//some lack of directions/instructions
//no follow camera option

//good game
Personal Suggested Purchase Price: $0.99 Or Less During Sale
extra notes:
//You gather animal rioters to take down government controlling oppressors
